---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: whenNotPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_canceled: whenSaleCanceled
    q_check_canceled --> q_get_position: positionId = getInvestorPositionId(sender)
    q_get_position --> q_verify_exists: verifyPositionExists(positionId)
    q_verify_exists --> q_verify_not_refunded: verifyHasNotRefunded(positionId)
    q_verify_not_refunded --> q_cache_amount: amountToWithdraw = position.investedCapital
    q_cache_amount --> q_check_nonzero: amountToWithdraw > 0
    q_check_nonzero --> q_zero_capital: amount > 0
    q_check_nonzero --> q_revert: amount == 0
    q_revert --> [*]: revert InvalidWithdrawAmount(0)
    q_zero_capital --> q_decrement: position.investedCapital = 0
    q_decrement --> q_emit: totalCapitalInvested -= amountToWithdraw
    q_emit --> [*]: safeTransfer(bidToken, sender, amountToWithdraw)

    note right of q_check_canceled
        INV-001: withdrawal only available when sale is canceled
        INV-002: investor must not have already refunded
        INV-003: investedCapital set to 0 before transfer (CEI)
    end note
